 {
  "type": "verdict",
  "text": "The sources agree that the settlement of the Murdoch succession dispute was announced in a statement from News Corp and Fox on September 8, 2025, with 11 sources giving that date, and they also broadly agree that roughly $1.1 billion was reported as paid to Rupert Murdoch's three eldest children, since 7 sources give that figure against 1 giving $3.3 billion. They disagree on the date the Nevada probate commissioner filed the sealed 'Project Family' ruling, with most sources (7) saying December 7, 2024, others saying December 9, 2024 or just December 2024, and on whether the Reno probate hearing began September 16, 2024 (6 sources) or September 17, 2024 (1 source); they also split on Lachlan Murdoch's voting stake in the new Murdoch Family Trust, with figures of 33 percent, 36 percent, and 36.2 percent. No primary source was found for any of these contested points, so the conflicting values remain unresolved in the record, and no source count was available for the total registered shares Rupert Murdoch moved to the new trust in September 2023."
 },
